    'Required event names include tenant.provisioned, tenant.suspended, subscriber.created, service.activated, service.suspended, payment.succeeded, payment.failed, payment.reversed, invoice.overdue, session.started, session.stopped, quota.thresholdReached, router.offline, connector.revoked, ticket.created, and ticket.resolved. Event delivery is best effort only for external consumers; internal state changes remain transactionally durable before publication.'
